    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/159178f0ed760d7e07d3c7d2448a6127.avif?t=1635188270\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/b548538912cb9b3e3d6dc2e117c24350.poster.avif?t=1635188270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/b548538912cb9b3e3d6dc2e117c24350.webm?t=1635188270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/b548538912cb9b3e3d6dc2e117c24350.mp4?t=1635188270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/8cac10733685ddee5faafd0b5de53c40.avif?t=1635188270\" /></div><br>---PERFORM EXPERIMENTS ON LIVE SCP SUBJECTS---<br>SCP-8008: THE NOVELTY GLASSES - A COGNITOHAZARDOUS PIECE OF EYEWEAR THAT ALLOWS THE USER TO FALL IN LOVE WITH LITERALLY ANYTHING.<br>BECAUSE OF YOUR COGNITIVE RESISTANCE VALUE YOU HAVE RECEIVED CLASS-5 AUTHORIZATION TO TEST THEM ON SCP-173, SCP-682, and SCP-096.<br><br><strong>[[Talk to 3 different SCP girls in intense visual novel-style dialogue sections. Make decisions that will impact the course of the story.]]</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/8c5957e3cfc406c4775aeb9dfc06af84.avif?t=1635188270\" /></div><br><br>---BEWARE THE HALLUCENTATIONS---<br>OF THE ORIGINAL FOUR RESEARCHERS YOU ARE THE ONLY SURVIVOR. THE OTHERS WERE KILLED BY AN H2 PENCIL, A DIAMOND NECKLACE, AND A POOL NOODLE RESPECTIVELY.<br><br><strong>[[Resist the voices in your head as you play Match-3 games in your dreams. Remember, if you don't get a high enough score, you may never wake up.]]</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/0942242e0600af6c334348421819d7ba.avif?t=1635188270\" /></div><br><br>---YOUR CHOICES DETERMINE YOUR FATE---<br>THE DECISIONS YOU MAKE IN YOUR CONSCIOUS AND SUBCONSCIOUS HOURS DETERMINE THE BRANCH YOUR STORY TAKES.<br><br><strong>[[Choose dialogue options and pick how to play the Match-3 sections to change the outcome of the story.]]</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/86a8949bb882ce311dddf837ecee71ab.avif?t=1635188270\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/159178f0ed760d7e07d3c7d2448a6127.avif?t=1635188270\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/b548538912cb9b3e3d6dc2e117c24350.poster.avif?t=1635188270\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/b548538912cb9b3e3d6dc2e117c24350.webm?t=1635188270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/b548538912cb9b3e3d6dc2e117c24350.mp4?t=1635188270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/8cac10733685ddee5faafd0b5de53c40.avif?t=1635188270\" /></div><br>---PERFORM EXPERIMENTS ON LIVE SCP SUBJECTS---<br>SCP-8008: THE NOVELTY GLASSES - A COGNITOHAZARDOUS PIECE OF EYEWEAR THAT ALLOWS THE USER TO FALL IN LOVE WITH LITERALLY ANYTHING.<br>BECAUSE OF YOUR COGNITIVE RESISTANCE VALUE YOU HAVE RECEIVED CLASS-5 AUTHORIZATION TO TEST THEM ON SCP-173, SCP-682, and SCP-096.<br><br><strong>[[Talk to 3 different SCP girls in intense visual novel-style dialogue sections. Make decisions that will impact the course of the story.]]</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/8c5957e3cfc406c4775aeb9dfc06af84.avif?t=1635188270\" /></div><br><br>---BEWARE THE HALLUCENTATIONS---<br>OF THE ORIGINAL FOUR RESEARCHERS YOU ARE THE ONLY SURVIVOR. THE OTHERS WERE KILLED BY AN H2 PENCIL, A DIAMOND NECKLACE, AND A POOL NOODLE RESPECTIVELY.<br><br><strong>[[Resist the voices in your head as you play Match-3 games in your dreams. Remember, if you don't get a high enough score, you may never wake up.]]</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/0942242e0600af6c334348421819d7ba.avif?t=1635188270\" /></div><br><br>---YOUR CHOICES DETERMINE YOUR FATE---<br>THE DECISIONS YOU MAKE IN YOUR CONSCIOUS AND SUBCONSCIOUS HOURS DETERMINE THE BRANCH YOUR STORY TAKES.<br><br><strong>[[Choose dialogue options and pick how to play the Match-3 sections to change the outcome of the story.]]</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1743380/extras/86a8949bb882ce311dddf837ecee71ab.avif?t=1635188270\" /></div>",
